- Architecture: feature-first (lib/features/<feature>/{data,domain,presentation}).
- State: Riverpod. Navigation: go_router. Backend: Firebase project `ofran-7a7c5`.
- Visual identity: navy/snow (`#050D1C` splash, `#F6F8FB` screens, `#0F3D63` buttons), gold `#C9A24B`, Cairo. Logo: `assets/brand/ghofran_logo.png`. First launch plays `assets/brand/ghofran_splash.gif`, then login.
- Drawer navigation from the start (RTL right). Clean cards, 2×2 home tiles, no bottom tab bar.
- Never store confession content. Only booking metadata. Conscience exam answers stay on-device only.
- After each task: run `flutter analyze` and fix all warnings. Keep widgets small and reusable.
- Don't add packages without telling me why.
